# API & Communication

## Envelope (all responses)

```json
{
  "status": "success" | "error",
  "data": { },
  "message": "Human readable message",
  "errors": [ ]
}
```

Frontend: unwrap with `apiEnvelope<T>()` from `$lib/api/client.ts`.

## REST vs RPC

- **REST:** CRUD for Campaigns, Characters, Items, Wiki, Templates.
- **RPC-style actions:** e.g. `POST /api/campaigns/{id}/start-session`, `POST /api/dice/roll`, `POST /api/combat/{id}/next-turn`, `POST /api/character-sheets`, `POST /api/item-cards`.

## WebSocket (when implemented)

- One connection per client for chat, combat, dice.
- JSON messages: `{ "type": "chat_message" | "combat_update" | ..., "payload": { } }`.
